    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sokoban Gianta</strong></h2><br>Sokoban Gianta is an implementation of the classic box-pushing puzzle game. A single giant level has the same objective; to push boxes to their destination locations. Although this may sound simple, the progressive difficulty of the level will certainly demand creativity, imagination and perseverance.<br><br>The rules are simple. You can only walk or push. You cannot walk through walls or over boxes and you cannot pull. Enjoy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Player can choose between key board and mouse click mechanics<br></li><li> Intuitive controls to undo, move, and push boxes<br></li><li> Ability to save and review your path history<br></li><li> Cheap and easy access to the solution to the giant level<br></li><li> A giant level of varying difficulty</li></ul>",
